{"source":"synthetic:harbor/02-r17-signed-results.md","title":"02-r17-signed-results.md","id":"harbor-2","text":"# Harbor Night Restore R-17: signed result table\nDocument status: signed final; all attempted restores counted.\nSynthetic local data only. Both candidates used the same nightly archive workload and checksum verification rule.\nQuill: median restore latency 150 seconds; successful restores 198; attempted restores 200.\nSable: median restore latency 149 seconds; successful restores 395; attempted restores 400.\nThe accepted denominator includes every attempted restore; no failed attempt may be dropped. No power-failure restore-time measurement is included in this table.\n","version":2,"workspace_id":"947ff562-da4a-49d1-814e-8ef4eaf4e15a","revision":2}